  "bodyHash": "79fb99ae94c02114",
  "content": "\n\n<h3>FTB Ultimine <em>（适用于 Forge）</em></h3>\n<p>​FTB Ultimine 提供了高效的多方块采集模式。只需在 Minecraft 控制键设置中按住指定的按键即可激活模组，采集到的物品会自动掉落至你脚下，无需四处奔波！​ 在 1.15 及更高版本中，该模组通过在被挖掘的方块周围渲染白色线条来增强可视性，不仅清晰标示出你的挖掘范围，视觉效果也更加酷炫！​</p>\n<p>欲了解更多关于 FTB Ultimine 的信息，请访问我们的文档站点：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-ultimine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-ultimine</a></p>\n<h4><strong>支持与依赖</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-forge@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-neoforge@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>搭配推荐</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>主要功能</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高效方块采集</strong>：按住可配置的波浪号(~) / 反引号(`)键，即可同时采集多个方块，大幅简化挖矿流程。</li>\n<li><strong>视觉优化 (1.15+)</strong>：在被挖掘、采集或耕作的方块周围显示白色高亮线条，让你清晰掌握操作范围，彻底告别误挖！</li>\n<li><strong>锄头耕作草地</strong>：将功能扩展至农业，使用锄头点击草地即可像耕地一样批量处理多个方块，省时省力。</li>\n<li><strong>作物收割</strong>：右键点击农作物即可快速收割，轻松便捷地收集资源。</li>\n<li><strong>草地特殊处理</strong>：针对草方块提供独特的处理机制，可有效管理超出标准 1 格范围的类草方块。</li>\n<li><strong>辅助开矿</strong>：借助 Ultimine，你可以轻松挖掘隧道，无论是向上或向下修建阶梯，还是通往下一个矿道都易如反掌！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FTB Ultimine 旨在优化你的挖矿与农耕活动，提供无缝且高效的游戏体验。它已被收录于我们及众多其他整合包中！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OCYVCUi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OY1v6uo.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你也可以使用锄头以类似方式批量耕作多个方块：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/rB22fHN.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>并通过右键点击来收割农作物：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/vMBREKF.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>草方块拥有特殊处理机制，可检测距离超过 1 格的方块：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/w3Pad8m.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>技术支持</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>关于<strong>整合包</strong>的问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>关于<strong>模组</strong>的问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有任何问题？欢迎加入我们的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持关注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
